  "prefLabel": "Rev 1501.20 Total net book value in New Hampshire",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.20 \"Total net book value in New Hampshire\" means the total original cost less depreciation and amortization, including tangible and intangible assets located exclusively inside of New Hampshire. The term does not include non-railroad assets.\n\nSource. #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
